WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:08.694
Academic year and terms

00:00:08.744 --> 00:00:11.984
Open Management, then Sessions.

00:00:14.873 --> 00:00:19.280
Choose Sessions

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:26.962
Each year card shows its terms on a timeline. This year has none yet, so the bar is hatched.

00:00:27.416 --> 00:00:30.296
Press Manage terms on the year.

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:39.651
Press Add Term. The first term is created for you, starting on the first day of the year.

00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:48.490
Drag the end handle to stretch it. Changes save by themselves, so there is no Save button.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:55.358
Add the next term. It starts the day after the first one ends.

00:00:56.511 --> 00:01:00.015
Drag its end handle towards the end of the year.

00:01:01.677 --> 00:01:07.677
Fine tune with the arrow keys. Hold Shift to move a week at a time.

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:14.106
If a term overlaps another, you get a warning, and the change waits until you confirm.

00:01:16.779 --> 00:01:21.147
Move the start back out of the other term, and it saves again.

00:01:29.085 --> 00:01:33.741
Close the window, and both terms show on the year's timeline.

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:40.505
Your terms are set up
